        "type": "remove",
        "target": "self"
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Snap-to-stop for camera-relative movement. The engine queues `stop` (stop_action_on_idle, default) when no movement key is held; velocity_add_relative doesn't fire then, so WITHOUT this the player glides forever (state.drag + zero_velocity_pretick are unimplemented since the ADR 0044 body migration). Mirrors @lib.input_bundles.wasd_with_fp_variant lib_wasd_stop. 2026-06-06.",
      "id": "player_stop_on_idle",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "input",
        "action": "stop"
      },
      "query": {
        "tags_all": [
          "player"
        ]
      },
      "effect": {
        "type": "velocity_set",
        "target": "actor",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "SPACE -> grounded jump. Sets y_velocity; character_body_runner mirrors it into the body + gravity (state.gravity=18) brings the player back. require on_floor==1 = no double-jump. Mirrors demo_lanterns 12_shell_jump.",
      "id": "player_jump",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "input",
        "action": "jump"
      },
      "require": {
        "actor": {
          "tags_all": [
            "player"
          ],
          "state": {
            "on_floor_eq": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "effect": [
        {
          "type": "state_set",
          "target": "actor",
          "field": "y_velocity",
          "value": 7.0
        },
        {
          "type": "state_set",
          "target": "actor",
          "field": "on_floor",
          "value": 0
        }
      ]
